{time: 4/4}

{comment: Intro}
| [Bb] | [Bb] | [Bb] | [Bb] |

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
The Advo[Dm7]cate comes to [Gm]stay
The Spirit [Dm]of truth remains
[Eb]He dwells within [Bb]your heart to[Gm]day
The [Cm7]world sees nothing but the faintest [Fsus4]pain
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
